silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_flat_sections_05_cannon_or_gpt_absorption_concrete_anchor_node3 silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensApex_05_cannon_or_gpt_absorption is Mittens is the colimit apex — the governed individual cat. All arrows in 05_cannon_or_gpt_absorption ultimately point toward Mittens. Mittens is NOT a source leg, NOT a storage packet, NOT a KG node. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Mittens (governed individual apex)', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
